Package: cockpit-shr-rs
Version: %{VERSION}-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: heavycaffeiner <146043537+heavycaffeiner@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/heavycaffeiner/shr-rs
Depends: cockpit-bridge, shr-rs
Description: Cockpit dashboard for the SHR-RS RAID manager
 Cockpit web dashboard for the SHR-RS RAID manager: live drive, mdadm array,
 group and band panels with per-band sync progress and scrub history, plus a
 group-creation wizard and an operations panel (scrub, expand, disk replace,
 recompress, snapshot, schedule install, destroy).
 .
 Every destructive action requires a dry-run preview first and confirmation by
 typing the exact group name, and runs with superuser: "require" -- so an
 unprivileged Cockpit session cannot reach any write path.
